abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the manuscript "Diagnosing Spectral Identifiability
  Failures in Task-Sensitive Parameter Geometry: A Vision Transformer Case Study".
  The package contains the public code, configurations, manifests, compact results,
  diagnostics, and provenance records needed to reproduce the reported analyses.
keywords:
  - spectral identifiability
  - parameter-space geometry
  - finite-sample stability
  - task sensitivity
  - Vision Transformers
  - reproducibility
